mcp.agentPrompt:
Connect to my local ValoUtils MCP server and add it as an MCP server named "valoutils".
- Transport: Streamable HTTP
- URL: {{url}}
- Header: Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Then list its tools. It reads my Valorant rank, recent matches, the live match, store, battle pass and settings, looks up any player by Riot ID, and can open Valorant. Keep the token private.
